# jemdoc: menu{menu}{default.html}
= Gen Li

~~~
{}{img_left}{photo-gen.jpg}{alt text}{}{240}
I am an Assistant Professor in the Department of Statistics at the Chinese University of Hong Kong.

Previously, I was a postdoctoral researcher in the [https://statistics.wharton.upenn.edu Department of Statistics and Data Science] at the Wharton School at University of Pennsylvania, co-advised by Professor [https://yuxinchen2020.github.io Yuxin Chen] and Professor [https://yutingwei.github.io Yuting Wei]. I received my Ph.D. in the Department of Electronic Engineering at Tsinghua University, advised by Professor [http://gu.ee.tsinghua.edu.cn/ Yuantao Gu]. Before my Ph.D., I received my bachelor's degree from the Department of Electronic Engineering and Department of Mathematics at Tsinghua University in 2016. \n
\n
I am interested in diffusion based generative model, reinforcement learning, high-dimensional statistics, machine learning, signal processing, and mathematical optimization. \n
\n
